---
<section id="education" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-heading">Education</h2>
    <div class="school-header">
      <img class="logo" src="/images/ou-logo.svg" alt="University of Oklahoma" />
      <h3>University of Oklahoma</h3>
    </div>
    <p class="degree">Bachelor's Degree — Spanish Language &amp; Literature, and International Studies</p>
    <p class="body-text">
      I studied Spanish Language &amp; Literature and International Studies at the University of
      Oklahoma, spent a semester abroad in Buenos Aires at Universidad de Belgrano, and closed out
      my degree on the President's Honor Roll with a 4.0 GPA. I also led a group of volunteers
      supporting international student organizations on campus.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .school-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .logo {
    height: 1.75rem;
    width: auto;
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .degree {
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .body-text {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
